Source: rk3588-camera-dkms
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Peyton Howe <peyton@localhost>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), dh-dkms, dkms
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/peyton-howe/ubuntu-image-builder

Package: rk3588-camera-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dkms, linux-headers-generic | linux-headers-virtual | linux-headers-arm64
Description: DKMS drivers for RK3588 cameras (IMX708, rkisp2, DCPHY)
 Out-of-tree modules extracted from the ubuntu-image-builder mainline
 camera patch series. IMX708 is wired for AUTOINSTALL. rkisp2 and the
 Samsung DCPHY CSI-RX replacement are staged in the source tree and
 enabled as their out-of-tree Makefiles stabilize.
